c/cljc/yang/core/prelude.cljc:34:  (walk/postwalk (partial strip ns-str) form))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:4:   yin.repl.dao.space-index.md, \\\"DHT store\\\").  It is composed with the\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:37:   slice H3) is composed here too, the shell owning the file, the lines\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:321:(defn- compose\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:414:       (compose node base checked follow records\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:439:   closed and no dial is composed again, and the node is marked\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:659:   `[pub lines]`.  A stopping node composes no board.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:766:  \"Advance the dial of `principal`'s board at `now`: compose one when\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:967:          ;; a stopping node composes and steps no dial\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc:972:          ;; a lost source: drop its dial; the next is composed after the\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/driver.cljc:345:   fresh URL composes a new boundary.  The codec is CBOR unless named.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc:5209:       (walk/postwalk (fn [x] (if (contains? clash x) (symbol (str x \"%l\")) x)) form))]))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3913:                                           (walk/postwalk rewrite (unit-node ctx true))))))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/host/common.cljc:11:   adapter, and the diagnostic for a host that composed none.  `yin.repl.host`\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/host/common.cljc:23:  (str \"no host WebSocket package is composed for this build: the REPL \"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/host/common.cljc:29:  \"True for a host adapter this slice can compose a client boundary from.\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:2193:     ;; Decompose each bound first: stop-start need not fit the budget.\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:2241:                      body (walk/postwalk rewrite (lower-module-body packet unit))\nsrc/cljc/yang/docs/architecture.md:164:(def composed-ast\nsrc/cljc/yang/docs/architecture.md:172:(walker/run initial-state composed-a